    {
      "id": "v",
      "kind": "vars",
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "id": "code",
      "kind": "code",
      "lang": "python",
      "source": "def isValid(s):\n    pairs = {')':'(', ']':'[', '}':'{'}\n    stack = []\n    for ch in s:\n        if ch in pairs:\n            if not stack or stack.pop() != pairs[ch]:\n                return False\n        else:\n            stack.append(ch)\n    return not stack"
    },
    {
      "id": "ctext",
      "kind": "text",
      "title": "Why it's fast",
      "body": [
        "Each character is pushed and popped at most once → O(n)",
        "The stack holds at most n brackets → O(n) space"
      ],
      "variant": "bullets"
    },
    {
      "id": "otext",
      "kind": "text",
      "body": [
        "The stack IS the memory",
        "of what's still open."
      ],
      "variant": "big"
    }
  ],
